      "content": "Marcus's methodical approach suggests strong process control, which is valuable, but you are right to question his cultural fit. Before deciding, probe his responses during the interview specifically regarding high-pressure, unpredictable situations. Ask him how he handles sudden pivots or when an established plan completely fails to yield results. This will reveal if his structure is a strength or a rigidity in the chaos you need him to thrive within.",
      "source": "target",
